  "2026-10-29T13:44:59.324Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: the complete live 3152-item all-status corpus has zero omissions or unreadable records. Request-specific search and fresh open/in_progress inventories found no active selected-dispatch owner. Full live pm-tzwy metadata comments and history confirm its earlier CI optimization is completed. Current nightly.yml declares no manual inputs. This intake remains open and unclaimed; it does not change workflows or excuse any pending native acceptance."
  "2026-10-29T15:08:39.378Z","harness:codex","Operational evidence from PR1623: new Nightly40894940536 stayed pending after automatic concurrency cancellation of40883494351. The superseded run retained a queued aggregate job although all native jobs were terminal (both macOS and all4 Windows successful; Linux legs canceled). Force-canceling only that superseded owned run releases its concurrency slot; all useful logs are retained. A selected dispatch improvement must retain exact-head and complete-default semantics and should document this separate stale-run recovery behavior."
